# Working directory. Everything in here is regenerated by the build scripts.
build/

# Generated by the compliance-check scripts each run.
docs/compliance-report.txt
compliance-report.html

# LaTeX side-files, in case anything is ever run outside build/
*.aux
*.log
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.bbl
*.bcf
*.blg
*.out
*.run.xml
*-luamml-mathml.html

# NOT ignored, on purpose:
#   the delivered PDF   whatever output-name in config/thesis-config.tex calls
#                       it, copied to the root after a successful build. It is
#                       the copy you submit, and keeping it in version control
#                       means a fresh clone ships a working demonstration PDF
#                       without anyone having to build first. Rename the rule
#                       above if you ever want it ignored instead.
#   figures/*.pdf       source assets, not build output.
